{
  "slug": "daloopa",
  "name": "Daloopa",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Financial analysis skills powered by Daloopa's institutional-grade data",
  "longDescription": "Ships **21 skills** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (21): `build-model` (Build a multi-tab Excel financial model), `bull-bear` (Bull/bear/base case scenario framework for a given company), `capital-allocation` (Deep dive into capital deployment, buybacks, dividends, and shareholder yield), `comp-sheet` (Build an industry comp sheet Excel model with deep operational KPIs), `comps` (Trading comparables analysis with peer multiples and implied valuation), `dcf` (Discounted cash flow valuation with sensitivity analysis), `earnings-flash` (Rapid first-read earnings flash for a given company), `earnings-prep` (Pre-earnings preparation report for the night before a company reports), and 13 more\n- **MCP servers** (2): `daloopa`, `daloopa-docs`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install daloopa@knowledge-work-plugins` from `daloopa/plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
